                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 75-year-old female patient, who presented on 07/01/2021 with fever, dry cough, dyspnoea, and reduced oxygen saturation. A nasopharyngeal swab confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. Chest X-ray and CT thorax revealed bilateral COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests showed elevated inflammatory markers including CRP and D-dimer. The patient was treated with supplemental oxygen therapy, dexamethasone, prophylactic anticoagulation, and supportive intravenous fluids. Pulse oximetry was monitored continuously. She showed gradual clinical improvement and was mobilised with physiotherapy support. At discharge on 19/01/2021, oxygen saturation was stable on room air. She is discharged home with instructions for continued recovery and follow-up. Please monitor respiratory function and inflammatory markers at your earliest convenience. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Treating Physician]</div>
               </text>
